SUMMARY:SUSAN WOODSON: FEATURED ARTIST - Third Friday Opening Reception
DESCRIPTION:5 Points Gallery is proud to present a new exhibition by Featured Artist Susan Woodson. Drawing inspiration from the natural world\, Woodson explores the space between observation and imagination in paintings rich with color\, texture\, and movement. Through layered surfaces\, bold marks\, and expressive gestures\, she creates abstract compositions that reflect both careful examination and imaginative interpretation of nature. Join us for the Third Friday Reception on June 19\, 2026\, from 6–9 pm to meet the artist and experience this vibrant new body of work. The exhibition runs from June 18 through July 11\, 2026. Image: Into the Woods\, acrylic\, 30×24 inches. \nVisit 5 Points Gallery in person or online at https://5pointsgallery.com. All work from the exhibition is available for shipping or pickup. Gallery hours: Thursdays and Fridays 5–9pm\, Saturdays 1–9pm. Artists are available to talk about their work. For a private viewing\, contact us at info@5pointsgallery.com.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/susan-woodson-featured-artist-third-friday-opening-reception/
LOCATION:5 Points Gallery\, 109 E Chapel Hill St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Third Friday
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Susan-Woodson-Into-the-Woods-3.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="5 points gallery":MAILTO:info@5pointsgallery.com
GEO:35.9970428;-78.9034674
