SUMMARY:Party at Future Hooman
DESCRIPTION:Our Flux & Drift party series at Future Hooman is back in June during the Downtown Durham 3rd Friday Art Walk! We’re celebrating the coming solstice with our themed party: \nTHE LONG NIGHT\n– Enjoy DJs & Dreamwaves\n– Wander our Interactive Exhibit Space\n– Party with Curious Beautiful Weirdos\n– Snack on Light Nibbles & Drinks\n– Join our Solstice Connection Experiment (optional) \nCome ready to have fun\, connect with other creative folks\, and ascend to the next level (if your team wins). Celestial oriented costumes & character role play is encouraged! The exhibit will be open with new goodies we’ve added in the last month. \nParty starts at 7pm and runs til we get tired and go home. Feel free to drop by anytime before 10pm. \nSpace is limited so please RSVP at our partiful below: \nhttps://partiful.com/e/qdZ4MbQaIe8L43jR6U1m?c=SuYBW_v9
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/party-at-future-hooman/
LOCATION:Future Hooman\, 109 W Orange St\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Art,Costumes,Craft,Date Night,Game Night,Mixers and Parties,Networking,Third Friday
