SUMMARY:Pride Drag Show
DESCRIPTION:Be entertained by fabulous performers to celebrate Pride! \nJoin us for an unforgettable night of glitz\, glamour\, and celebration at Glass Jug Downtown’s Pride Drag Show! This dazzling extravaganza promises to wow you with three amazing performers over a fantastic selection of beverages. \nThe taps will be flowing with brews and we’re crafting cocktails just for the occasion. Take in the glittering show starting at 7pm\, hosted by the incomparable Miss B Haven. Then be dazzled by a performance from the marvelous Fête D. Ville. And topping off the night is the stunning Espi O’Najj. It’s a daring trio whose moves can’t be beat. \nEveryone 18+ up is welcome\, so come ready to cheer\, sip\, and sing along as we turn the taproom into a celebration of Pride! It’s going to be a night you won’t want to miss\, as we celebrate the Pride season with style and sass. \nTickets are $10 in advance\, $20 at the door. Arrive early for best seats. Space is limited\, get your spot reserved now here. \nView on Facebook.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/pride-drag-show/
LOCATION:Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Craft,Food & Drink,LGBTQ,Pride,Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Pride-Drag-Show.jpg
