SUMMARY:Father’s Day Brunch
DESCRIPTION:Bring the dad figures in your life to brunch on Sunday\, June 21 at the Coffee Bar at The Durham. \nBrunch runs 11 AM to 3 PM. The first course arrives family style: roasted local corn muffins with honey butter and beer-battered onion rings with caramelized sweet onion ranch. Entrées range from a grilled bone-in pork chop with local peach-sweet tea glaze to fried NC flounder over Atkinson Mill stone-ground grits. A dedicated kids’ menu rounds things out for the little ones. \n$50 per adult | $25 per child
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/fathers-day-brunch/
